<title>USA: Brightpoint to distribute Sony telephones.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint to distribute Sony telephones.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Thursday it has signed an agreement to become an authorized distributor for Sony's cellular telephones and related accessories in certain markets.</p>
<p>The agreement is with Sony Wireless Telecommunications Co, a unit of Sony Corp's Sony Electronics Inc, Brightpoint said.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
